# {{lb|en|nautical|or|aeronautical|where the frame of reference is within the craft}} At or towards the [[stern]] of a ship or the rear of an aircraft.
#: {{ux|en|The '''after''' gun is mounted aft.}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''after''' gun is abaft the forward gun.}}
