#* {{quote-book|en|author=Sherry Petersik; John Petersik|title=Young House Love: 243 Ways to Paint, Craft, Update & Show Your Home Some Love|location=New York, N.Y.|publisher=[[w:Workman Publishing Company#Imprints|Artisan]]|year=2012|page=16|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/younghouselove240000pete/page/16/mode/1up|column=2|isbn=978-1-57965-478-8|passage=So with that in mind, we thought it might be helpful to put some pictures where our mouths are, and include some less-than-flattering photos of our first house after we’d lived there eight whole months. Spoiler alert: We were miiiles away from the “'''afters'''” that we shared on pages 6 and 7.}}

